{
  "sourceLanguage" : "zh-Hans",
  "strings" : {
    "勾选的渠道都已停用" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selected channels are all off"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "勾選的管道都已停用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "尚未获得「辅助功能」权限，自动跳过无法生效" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Accessibility permission hasn’t been granted, so automatic skipping is unavailable"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "尚未获得「辅助功能」权限，自动跳过无法生效"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "尚未取得「輔助使用」權限，自動略過無法生效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "更新后原有授权已失效。请在系统设置中通过「−」移除 Lyrimuse，再通过「+」重新添加，然后点按「重启歌词引擎」" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After the update, the previous permission is no longer valid. In System Settings, remove Lyrimuse with “−”, add it again with “+”, then click Restart Lyrics Engine"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更新后原有授权已失效。请在系统设置中通过「−」移除 Lyrimuse，再通过「+」重新添加，然后点按「重启歌词引擎」"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更新後原有授權已失效。請在系統設定中透過「−」移除 Lyrimuse，再透過「+」重新加入，然後按一下「重新啟動歌詞引擎」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请在系统设置中开启 Lyrimuse，然后点按「重启歌词引擎」。若已开启但仍未生效，请通过「−」移除 Lyrimuse，再通过「+」重新添加" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn on Lyrimuse in System Settings, then click Restart Lyrics Engine. If it’s already on but has no effect, remove Lyrimuse with “−” and add it again with “+”"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在系统设置中开启 Lyrimuse，然后点按「重启歌词引擎」。若已开启但仍未生效，请通过「−」移除 Lyrimuse，再通过「+」重新添加"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請在系統設定中開啟 Lyrimuse，然後按一下「重新啟動歌詞引擎」。若已開啟但仍未生效，請透過「−」移除 Lyrimuse，再透過「+」重新加入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重启后仍无法读取。请确认 Lyrimuse 已开启；若已开启，请通过「−」移除后再通过「+」重新添加" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Still unable to read after restarting. Make sure Lyrimuse is turned on; if it is, remove it with “−” and add it again with “+”"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重启后仍无法读取。请确认 Lyrimuse 已开启；若已开启，请通过「−」移除后再通过「+」重新添加"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重新啟動後仍無法讀取。請確認 Lyrimuse 已開啟；若已開啟，請透過「−」移除後再透過「+」重新加入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 的歌词缓存和播放队列位于受保护的目录中。授权后可直接使用本机已有的歌词，并预先解析即将播放的歌曲；未授权时仍可联网查找歌词" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ stores its lyrics cache and play queue in protected folders. With access, lyrics already on this Mac are used directly and upcoming tracks are resolved in advance; without it, lyrics are still found online"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 的歌词缓存和播放队列位于受保护的目录中。授权后可直接使用本机已有的歌词，并预先解析即将播放的歌曲；未授权时仍可联网查找歌词"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 的歌詞快取和播放佇列位於受保護的目錄中。授權後可直接使用本機已有的歌詞，並預先解析即將播放的歌曲；未授權時仍可連線尋找歌詞"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 不向系统报告播放进度。授权后，Lyrimuse 将读取其界面上的播放时间进行校准，并在你点按随机或循环按钮时代为操作对应按钮。未授权时仍可使用，但自动连播时进度可能偏差 1～2 秒，且不提供随机和循环按钮" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ doesn’t report its playback position to the system. With access, Lyrimuse reads the time shown in its window to calibrate, and presses its shuffle or repeat button when you click one. Without access, the position may be off by 1–2 seconds during autoplay, and the shuffle and repeat buttons are unavailable"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 不向系统报告播放进度。授权后，Lyrimuse 将读取其界面上的播放时间进行校准，并在你点按随机或循环按钮时代为操作对应按钮。未授权时仍可使用，但自动连播时进度可能偏差 1～2 秒，且不提供随机和循环按钮"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 不向系統報告播放進度。授權後，Lyrimuse 將讀取其介面上的播放時間進行校正，並在你按一下隨機或循環按鈕時代為操作對應按鈕。未授權時仍可使用，但自動連播時進度可能偏差 1～2 秒，且不提供隨機和循環按鈕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "伴奏版，不采用人声歌词" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Instrumental version; vocal lyrics not used"
