    "未授权时无法准确读取播放进度，也无法控制播放" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Without it, the playback position drifts and the controls do nothing"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未授权时无法准确读取播放进度，也无法控制播放"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未授權時無法準確讀取播放進度，也無法控制播放"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未授权时无法准确识别%@正在播放的歌曲，也无法控制播放" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Without it, the song playing in %@ can’t be identified reliably, and playback can’t be controlled"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未授权时无法准确识别%@正在播放的歌曲，也无法控制播放"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未授權時無法準確識別%@正在播放的歌曲，也無法控制播放"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未授权时无法准确读取播放进度，也无法控制播放；%@正在播放的歌曲也可能识别不准" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Without it, the playback position is inaccurate and playback can’t be controlled; the song playing in %@ may also be misidentified"
