    },
    "出现「跳过」按钮时自动点按，无法跳过的广告照常播放。需要「辅助功能」权限。YouTube Music 位于后台标签页时将短暂切换至该标签页再切回，当前使用的浏览器窗口不受影响" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Presses Skip as soon as it appears; ads that can't be skipped still play. Needs Accessibility permission. If YouTube Music is in a background tab, Lyrimuse briefly switches to it and back without touching the browser window you're using"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
