    "在歌手前添加「演唱：」，在专辑前添加「专辑：」。歌名和歌手位于同一行时不添加" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adds “by” before the artist and “on” before the album. Not added when the title and artist share a line"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在歌手前加上「演唱：」，在專輯前加上「專輯：」。歌名和歌手位於同一行時不加上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「当前歌词」行最多每 4 秒切换一句，过短的句子将跳过；间奏、暂停或这首歌曲无歌词时显示专辑，专辑已占用一行时留空" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The “Current Lyric” line changes at most every 4 seconds, so very short lines are skipped. During instrumental breaks, while paused, or when the song has no lyrics, it shows the album, or stays empty if the album already has its own line"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「目前歌詞」行最多每 4 秒切換一句，過短的句子將略過；間奏、暫停或這首歌曲無歌詞時顯示專輯，專輯已佔用一行時留空"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discord 仅支持将第一行、第二行或「正在收听」后的内容显示在用户名下方。歌名和歌手均不在这些位置时，对应选项不可用" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Discord can only show the first line, the second line, or what follows “Listening to” under your name. If neither the title nor the artist is in one of those, that option is unavailable"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Discord 僅支援將第一行、第二行或「正在聆聽」後的內容顯示在使用者名稱下方。歌名和歌手均不在這些位置時，對應選項不可用"
          }
        }
      }
